{
  "title": "IAM · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "AWS API와 리소스에 대한 인증·인가를 제어한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#root-user\">Root User</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-users-and-groups\">IAM Users and Groups</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">IAM Roles</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#identity-based-and-resource-based-policies\">Identity-based and Resource-based Policies</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#managed-and-inline-policies\">Managed and Inline Policies</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#policy-elements-and-conditions\">Policy Elements and Conditions</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#permissions-boundaries-and-session-policies\">Permissions Boundaries and Session Policies</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#policy-evaluation\">Policy Evaluation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\">IAM Identity Center and Federation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#mfa-access-analyzer-and-least-privilege\">MFA, Access Analyzer and Least Privilege</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>28 / 62</span></div><h1>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 10 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 누가 어떤 조건에서 호출할 수 있는지 제어한다. Identity의 인증과 요청에 대한 Authorization을 구분하고, 사람이 사용하는 장기 Identity와 Workload의 임시 Role을 나누어 설계한다.</p><p>기본은 Implicit Deny이며 필요한 Allow가 있어야 한다. 적용되는 Policy의 Explicit Deny는 Allow보다 우선하므로 한 Policy만 확인해서 전체 권한을 판단하면 안 된다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"인증에서 권한 평가까지\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>인증에서 권한 평가까지</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Workload identity</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></strong><small>Role 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Temporary credentials</strong><small>SDK에서 사용</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> request</strong><small>Principal·Action·Resource</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Authorization</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Identity / Resource Policy</strong><small>필요 Allow 확인</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a> / Boundary / Session</strong><small>적용 제한·Explicit Deny</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Allow or Deny</strong><small>전체 Policy 평가 결과</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Network 접근과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Permission은 각각 충족해야 한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"root-user\"><h2>Root User<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#root-user\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>계정 생성 Identity로 강한 권한을 가진다. 일상 작업에는 사용하지 않고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#mfa-access-analyzer-and-least-privilege\">MFA</a>·연락처·복구 경로를 보호한다. Root 전용 작업과 관리 Identity의 작업을 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"iam-users-and-groups\"><h2>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> Users and Groups<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-users-and-groups\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>User는 장기 Identity이고 Group은 User에 Permission을 묶어 부여하는 단위다. Group은 독립적으로 AssumeRole하거나 Resource Policy의 Principal이 되는 Identity가 아니다. 장기 Access Key는 최소화하고 사용·회전·폐기를 관리한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"iam-roles\"><h2>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> Roles<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Role은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">Trust Policy</a>가 허용한 Principal이 Assume하여 임시 자격 증명을 받는 Identity다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> 등 Workload와 Cross-account 접근에 사용한다. Role 자체에 고정 Password·Access Key를 저장하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"identity-based-and-resource-based-policies\"><h2>Identity-based and Resource-based Policies<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#identity-based-and-resource-based-policies\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Identity Policy는 User·Group·Role에, Resource Policy는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 등 지원 리소스에 연결한다. Principal·Action·Resource·Condition으로 권한을 표현한다. Cross-account는 일반적으로 양쪽 계정의 허용 경계를 함께 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"managed-and-inline-policies\"><h2>Managed and Inline Policies<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#managed-and-inline-policies\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Managed Policy는 여러 Identity에서 재사용할 수 있고 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Managed·Customer Managed가 있다. Inline Policy는 특정 Identity에 종속된다. 재사용·Version 관리·최소 권한 요구에 따라 선택한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"policy-elements-and-conditions\"><h2>Policy Elements and Conditions<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#policy-elements-and-conditions\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Effect, Action, Resource와 Condition으로 요청을 제한한다. ARN <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Resource Name)</span>은 리소스 식별자이고 Wildcard는 허용 범위를 크게 만들 수 있다. Source IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#mfa-access-analyzer-and-least-privilege\">MFA</a>·Tag·SourceArn 같은 Condition Key는 해당 서비스가 제공하는 요청 Context와 맞아야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"permissions-boundaries-and-session-policies\"><h2>Permissions Boundaries and Session Policies<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#permissions-boundaries-and-session-policies\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Boundary는 Identity가 가질 수 있는 권한의 최대 범위를 제한한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#permissions-boundaries-and-session-policies\">Session Policy</a>는 임시 Session 권한을 추가로 제한한다. 둘 다 자체적으로 없는 권한을 부여하는 Allow의 대체재가 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"policy-evaluation\"><h2>Policy Evaluation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#policy-evaluation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Identity·Resource Policy, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>, Boundary, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#permissions-boundaries-and-session-policies\">Session Policy</a> 등의 결합을 평가한다. Explicit Deny가 우선하고 각 Policy 유형의 교집합·예외 규칙이 있다. Resource Policy가 직접 Session에 권한을 주는 경우처럼 세부 규칙은 공식 평가 문서를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"iam-identity-center-and-federation\"><h2>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> Identity Center and Federation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>사람의 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 계정·앱 접근을 중앙 Identity Provider와 연결하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\">Permission Set</a>으로 관리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\">SAML</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\">OIDC</a> 등 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-identity-center-and-federation\">Federation</a>은 외부 인증을 임시 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 접근과 연결한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 계정마다 장기 IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> User를 복제할 필요를 줄인다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"mfa-access-analyzer-and-least-privilege\"><h2>MFA <span class=\"full-name\">(Multi-Factor Authentication)</span>, Access Analyzer and Least Privilege<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#mfa-access-analyzer-and-least-privilege\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#mfa-access-analyzer-and-least-privilege\">MFA</a>는 인증 보호를 강화하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#mfa-access-analyzer-and-least-privilege\">Access Analyzer</a>는 외부 공유·미사용 권한 등 지원 분석을 돕는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a> 사용 내역을 참고해 필요한 Action만 허용한다. Network가 Private이어도 IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> 최소 권한은 별도로 필요하다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>를 읽을 때 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">Instance Profile</a>의 Role에 필요한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a> 읽기만 허용한다. Access Key를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>나 Source Code에 넣지 않는다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> 정책에서 Allow만 있어도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>나 명시적 Deny가 막으면 접근하지 못한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/introduction.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IAM/latest/UserGuide/introduction.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q061/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q061\" data-question=\"Q061\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q061</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q061/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application on EC2 needs S3 access. Instead of embedding a long-term access key in the AMI, what should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Embed the root account key</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Make the S3 bucket public</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an IAM role to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in the network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 역할을 통한 임시 자격 증명과 최소 권한 정책이 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q062\" data-question=\"Q062\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q062</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A principal needs temporary access by assuming a role in another AWS account. Which API action is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 HealthCheck</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">STS AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only S3 PutObject</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 AssociateAddress</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · AssumeRole은 역할의 임시 자격 증명을 얻는다. 양측 권한·신뢰 설정을 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q063\" data-question=\"Q063\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q063</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q063/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An IAM role policy allows an API action in a member account, but an organization SCP blocks that action. What is the result?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The IAM Allow takes precedence</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The action is denied by the SCP restriction</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>는 최대 권한 경계다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>의 Allow만으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>의 제한을 넘을 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q068\" data-question=\"Q068\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q068</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An administrator needs to audit who called an API to change an IAM policy. Which service should be checked first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The size of files in EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch CPU metrics</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동 이력을 기록한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q089\" data-question=\"Q089\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q089</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q089/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to use a role to access an S3 bucket in another account. Which TWO permission areas should it review?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only NAT gateway availability</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The role trust policy and permission to call AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q089\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The target bucket policy and the role&#x27;s S3 permissions</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, E</strong> · 교차 계정 역할을 맡을 수 있어야 하고, 맡은 뒤 리소스 액세스 정책도 맞아야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article></section>